Package: rkvm-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Zhendong Jia <jzd@sunsite.net.cn>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libevdev2, libgcc-s1, openssl
Recommends: systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/zhendongjia/rkvm
Description: network KVM server using Linux evdev and uinput
 rkvm captures keyboard and mouse events on a Linux server and forwards them
 over an authenticated TLS connection. This package contains the server,
 certificate generator, systemd unit, and an example configuration.
